    "flavor_text": {
      "one_line": "Numinan — wary clan confederation of the grassland; freedom, glory.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Numinan (Plains-nomad) are a expansionist clan confederation people seeded in grassland, scrubland, savanna. They prize freedom, glory, strength, lean toward the military sphere, and field horse_archers, light_cavalry, light_infantry. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch war, nature, storms."
